# Universal Shift Register

## Description
A 4-bit Universal Shift Register designed in Verilog.

The register can perform multiple operations based on the select inputs:
- Hold data
- Shift Left
- Shift Right
- Parallel Load

## Inputs
- clk : Clock signal
- rst : Reset signal
- sel[1:0] : Operation select
- din : Serial data input
- pdata[3:0] : Parallel data input

## Output
- q[3:0] : Register output

## Operation Table

| sel | Operation |
|------|-----------|
| 00 | Hold |
| 01 | Shift Right |
| 10 | Shift Left |
| 11 | Parallel Load |

## Features
- Synchronous operation
- 4-bit data width
- Supports serial and parallel data transfer
- Reset functionality

